WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.320
The Poincaré ball is a geometric map for complex data,

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:10.260
but how does it handle massive biological networks?

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.080
On a traditional flat graph,

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.480
branching pathways crowd together,

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.640
causing distinct signals to blur.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.840
Take a single starting molecule.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.560
It triggers three receptors,

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.640
which trigger three cascades,

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.360
fanning out toward thousands of outcomes.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.240
Map this on a flat grid,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.440
and the branches quickly run out of space.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.000
The nodes collide.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.120
When these branches overlap,

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.360
opposing signals like activate and inhibit

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.320
just average together into a blur.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.440
This data loss is called over smoothing.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:46.320
But warp that grid into a hyperbolic Poincaré ball

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.800
and the rules change.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.240
In this curved space,

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:51.960
the available room actually grows exponentially

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.480
the further you move toward the rim.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.280
Place that starting molecule back at the center.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:58.960
As the signal fans out,

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.960
thousands of outcomes fit perfectly along the outer rings

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:03.600
without colliding.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.640
Because every branch has its own room,

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.400
inhibitory signals can freely flip direction

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.760
without hitting their neighbors,

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.560
preserving the exact biological instruction.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.880
And that starting molecule from the beginning,

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:18.480
you can trace its exact unblurred path through the network,

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:21.160
predicting the final outcome with perfect clarity.
